== DESCRIPTION
The two declared errors of every checked creator: one coherent pair for the
whole family rather than twenty type-specific names. The creator a call
names already says which domain was meant; the error says which bound the
value violated (byte::from_int's and register64's two-error granularity).

== NOTES
A payload-free error of module abi, spelled abi::AbiIntegerBelowRange
in handlers and errors clauses outside it. A creator whose argument is
provably in range needs no handler; a provably out-of-range constant is
rejected as KNOWN-ERROR.

