nonnegative mask lies in 0..mask), which is how lib/byte.bot's functions
prove their Byte and Nibble results; a mask that is a container's size minus
one, with the size proven not 0, proves an index into it
(`a.at(bit_and(h, a.capacity() - 1))`, proof.list-bounds).

